    {
      "id": "p0128-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "A monster named Jerry is so annoying in battle that the player can team up with other enemies to \"ditch\" him. After several turns, however, Jerry will show up and annoy everyone again.",
        "raw": "A monster named Jerry is so annoying in battle that the player can team up\nwith other enemies to \"ditch\" him. After several turns, however, Jerry will\nshow up and annoy everyone again.",
