    {
      "id": "p0128-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In the English script, Jerry's arrival is accompanied by the text \"Return of Jerry\". Toby noted that this is a reference to the classic 1988 game, Zelda II: The Adventure ofL ink. Specifically, it's a reference to the game over screen, which includes the text \"RETURN OF GANON\".",
