    {
      "id": "p0128-b005",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "You know what, the ~ \"Gannon\" name should make a return someday, like maybe he'd be a copycat Ganon and the main villain in a spinoff game, but with everything slightly off about him",
