    {
      "id": "p0128-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The original Japanese version of Zelda II had a similar, English-language game over message: \"RETURN OF GANNON\". To retain this reference, the translator left \"RETURN OF JERRY\" entirely in English in the Japanese Underta/e script.",
        "raw": "The original Japanese version of Zelda II had a similar, English-language game\nover message: \"RETURN OF GANNON\". To retain this reference, the translator\nleft \"RETURN OF JERRY\" entirely in English in the Japanese Underta/e script.",
